  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Calls on the Commission to propose civil liability rules for robots, considering strict liability or risk management approaches and a compulsory insurance scheme.",
   "Proposes considering a specific legal status of 'electronic persons' for the most sophisticated autonomous robots in the long term.",
   "Recommends creating a European Agency for Robotics and AI and a registration system for advanced robots.",
   "Annexes a Charter on Robotics with a code of ethical conduct for engineers, research ethics committees, and designer and user licences.",
   "Addresses labour market impacts, education, privacy, and the need for common definitions and standards."
